# Always-review list for @bitwarden/team-ui-foundation
#
# BitReview reads this file to decide when this team's owner must review a change.
# It applies only to files that CODEOWNERS assigns to this team. A changed file that matches a
# line here always requires review from this team. Other files the team owns are routed by change kind.
#
# The syntax is the same as CODEOWNERS, and the last matching line wins. To stop always reviewing
# a path, delete its line, or add the path below the broader line with no owner.
#
# Seeded from CODEOWNERS. The team removes paths through PRs as it comes to trust change-kind routing.

